hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-action"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 7.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><p class="text-ink">Why call: opened your email twice, no reply. Marlow added a Sunday service in July. Who takes the weekend calls? <span class="text-muted">Their site, 20 Jul</span></p></div><h3 class="type-label mb-2 text-12">Log the outcome</h3><div role="group" aria-label="Log the outcome" class="flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action" data-testid="call-outcome">Spoke</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action" data-testid="call-outcome">Voicemail</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action" data-testid="call-outcome">No answer</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action" data-testid="call-outcome">Wrong number</button></div></section></div></div>"`;

