utton type="button" data-testid="queue-row" data-queue-row="" data-kind="draft" class="flex min-h-row w-full items-center gap-3 border-t border-line px-row-x py-row-y text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard bg-soft" aria-current="true"><span aria-hidden="true" class="grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-pill border border-line bg-ground text-11 font-semibold text-muted">DO</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block truncate text-13 font-semibold text-ink">Daniel Okoro</span><span class="block truncate text-12 text-muted">Email 1 of 3 · Kestrel Couriers</span></span><span class="type-mono shrink-0 text-11 text-muted">Thu</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-testid="queue-row" data-queue-row="" data-kind="draft" class="flex min-h-row w-full items-center gap-3 border-t border-line px-row-x py-row-y text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard hover:bg-ground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-pill border border-line bg-ground text-11 font-semibold text-muted">SM</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block truncate text-13 font-semibold text-ink">Sofia Marsh</span><span class="block truncate text-12 text-muted">Email 2 of 3 · Ridgeway Haulage</span></span><span class="type-mono shrink-0 text-11 text-muted">Thu</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><div class="mb-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><h2 class="type-name text-16">Daniel Okoro · Operations Director, Kestrel Couriers</h2><span class="type-mono shrink-0 text-12 text-muted">Email 1 of 3</span></div><div class="mb-3.5 flex gap-2.5 rounded-input bg-soft px-3 py-2.5 text-13"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-action"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 7.5l3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><p class="text-ink">Opened on: Kestrel is hiring six night-shift dispatchers. <span class="text-muted">Careers page, 2 Sep</span></p></div><p class="mb-1.5 text-15 font-semibold text-ink">Six dispatch hires and the phones that come with them</p><div data-testid="draft-body" class="type-body-large mb-4 max-w-measure"><p class="mb-2 last:mb-0">Daniel, six night dispatchers usually means the night line is already busy, and the calls that ring out while the team is on the road are the ones that go to somebody else. Conversant keeps that line answered without the hiring, and most ops directors we work with see the difference in the first fortnight. Would ten minutes on how the night line is covered today be worth your while?</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-12 font-medium border-transparent bg-soft text-action">Email found</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-12 font-medium border-line bg-ground text-muted">Fit: strong</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-12 font-medium border-line bg-ground text-muted">Sends Thu 09:00</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action">Approve</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action">Edit</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-0 bg-transparent px-0 text-muted ml-auto" aria-expanded="false">Reject…</button></div></section></div></div>"`;

