e have just taken on the Leeds depot and the phones are exactly the problem. Can you do Thursday afternoon?</p><p class="mb-2 last:mb-0">Priya</p></div><details data-testid="sent-email" class="mb-4 text-12 text-muted"><summary class="cursor-pointer rounded-input focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">Your email, sent Tue 09:00 · “Two new depots and the same ops headcount”</summary><div class="type-body mt-2 max-w-measure text-muted"><p class="mb-2 last:mb-0">Priya, two depots on the same ops headcount usually means the phones are the first thing to give.</p><p class="mb-2 last:mb-0">Would a look at how the Leeds line is covered be useful?</p></div></details><h3 class="type-label mb-2 text-12">Label this reply</h3><div role="group" aria-label="Label this reply" class="flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action" data-testid="reply-label">Warm</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action" data-testid="reply-label">Later</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action" data-testid="reply-label">No</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action" data-testid="reply-label">Stop</button></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-end"><a href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/inbox/id/relay-fixture-priya" class="rounded-pill text-13 font-semibold text-action focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">Reply from your mailbox →</a></div></section></div></div>"`;

